<p><strong>{{ monitorName }}</strong> is down.</p>

<p>Pulse could not reach it on its last check.</p>

<ul>
    <li>Monitor: {{ monitorName }}</li>
    <li>URL: {{ monitorUrl }}</li>
    <li>Reason: {{ cause|default('No reason reported.') }}</li>
    <li>Down since: {{ startedAt|date('Y-m-d H:i:s e') }}</li>
</ul>

<p><a href="{{ link }}">Open the monitor in Pulse</a></p>
